  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Singeprophet.jpg\" title=\"Singe Prophet\"><img alt=\"Singe Prophet\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"164\" src=\"/images/Singeprophet.jpg\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Singeprophet.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Singe Prophet</div></div></div>\n<p>Singe Prophet is a giant fighter Hero.  He is found someplace in The Tomb of Singe off Level 7 of Vergrim's Vexation. He is usually surrounded by <a href=\"/wiki/Fade_Skeleton\" title=\"Fade Skeleton\">Fades</a> who will get in the way of ranged attacks, and often accompanied by Crimson <a href=\"/wiki/Whisker_Venomspitter\" title=\"Whisker Venomspitter\">Spitters</a>.  He is reasonably hard to defeat but not impossible, and drops pretty good loot, lots of gold, yellows and an occasional purple.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
